+ *
+ * Parts adapted from the "mtk-soc" plugin of the MT6895-Mainline
+ * modemmanager-mtk-soc fork (GPL-2.0-or-later): the early CFUN=1 power-up
+ * and the list of proprietary URCs that must be swallowed.
